<title>THAILAND: Siam Commercial Bank Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Siam Commercial Bank Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ending 31 March, 1997.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				     For First Quarter</p>
<p>				     1997	   1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		   5.85	   5.37</p>
<p>    Net			2,227.30     2,042.30</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are unreviewed and unaudited. Siam Commercial Bank Plc is a leading commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
